exemptions:
The law excludes:
- owner-occupied premises with two or three units and two or fewer rental units;
- hotel, motel and guest house transient or seasonal guests, unless the occupant has no other residence;
- units held in trust for a developmentally disabled family member who permanently occupies the unit.

